{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm developing a small action adventure about a mouse in a forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/extras/Story_Banner.png?t=1742322240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Village</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take Care is about rebuilding a withering village by bringing back the people who used to live there but went away to find something better. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you grow up in a small town, the Idea of leaving might always be on your mind, but is there really anything &quot;better&quot; waiting for you? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">his game is about community and finding strength within it instead of abandoning it in search of something better for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/extras/Features_Banner.png?t=1742322240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a big forest with many different areas </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find new friends who lost their way somewhere on their journey and help them out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Acquire new gadgets that let you experience the forest in ever-changing ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve challenging puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your own playstyle by choosing between different weapons and armor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight a plethora of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience an original soundtrack by me :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Playing with a controller is heavily recommended! (Mouse and Keyboard works too if you don't have one, but please get one.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/extras/NoAi.png?t=1742322240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was made without any form of generative AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/extras/Credits.png?t=1742322240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540690?t=1742322240","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3540690?t=1742322240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/394b984673e79c287aa93bd26d786431f3226139/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742322240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/394b984673e79c287aa93bd26d786431f3226139/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742322240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I'm developing a small action adventure about a mouse in a forest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3540690/extras/Story_Banner.png?t=1742322240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Village</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take Care is about rebuilding a withering village by bringing back the people who used to live there but went away to find something better. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you grow up in a small town, the Idea of leaving might always be on your mind, 